### Levels

// Raising the level and forgetting it are admissible (code-lift). The
// level is LOAD-BEARING: with an external domain one level up — say
// (a : 𝕌ℓ) — the sort's decoding would contain 𝕌ℓ as a RETRACT
// (eliminate at constant motive 𝕌ℓ with method a ↦ a), the classic
// type-in-type collapse; so such a signature is at ℓ+1 and its sorts
// are 𝕌ℓ₊₁ types, and the model agrees — a universe cannot be
// constructed while consulting its own totality.

Γ ctx
-------------- (qctx-lvl-empty)
Γ ⊦ ε qctx ℓ

Γ ; Φ ⊦ 𝔄 qty ℓ
------------------ (qctx-lvl-ext)
Γ ⊦ Φ ▷ 𝔄 qctx ℓ

